[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; Same Theme/ancestor-walk wiring as unit-control-scene-font-theme.tscn — root
; Control, `theme = ExtResource(...)`, two Labels with no local font/size —
; but the Theme's `default_font` is a `.woff2` (Recursive, a variable Latin
; text face already vendored in the demos corpus, copied byte-for-byte —
; one of exactly two `.woff2` references anywhere in the corpus; the other is
; an icon font with no Latin glyphs to render). WOFF2's table data is
; Brotli-compressed and nothing in this webview can decompress it (no browser
; `DecompressionStream` brotli format, and the CSP blocks WASM), so
; `sfntTables.ts` returns null for it and the font's ascent/descent fall back
; to canvas
; `TextMetrics.fontBoundingBoxAscent`/`.fontBoundingBoxDescent`, measured
; against the SAME registered `FontFace` at a fixed 1000px reference size —
; a wholly different code path from the real `head`/`hhea` table read the
; sibling `.otf` fixture exercises. That fallback previously rested on a
; single scratch-probe measurement with no golden at all.
;
; The typeface is NOT the same as the sibling fixture's: no `.otf`/`.woff2`
; pair of the same face exists anywhere in the corpus, and vendoring one
; solely to make the pair match would be adding a font this repo does not
; already ship. So this scene is arbitrated on its OWN terms, directly
; against Godot's render of this exact scene — not by pixel comparison
; against unit-control-scene-font-theme.tscn's baseline, which proves nothing
; about a font neither renders.
;
; Godot 4.6.3, `--mode 2d`, arbitrated directly against this scene's own
; Godot render (never against the sibling's baseline — see above). Ink
; rows/columns measured off both renders (DirectLabel / NestedLabel, against
; the 64..700 plate each sits in):
;
;   DirectLabel  rows  Godot 56-85   ours 55-86    (1 px either edge)
;                cols  Godot 67-596  ours 67-596     exact
;   NestedLabel  rows  Godot 256-295 ours 255-295   (1 px)
;                cols  Godot 67-604  ours 67-604      exact
;
; Column extents match exactly; rows are within 1 px — the canvas-fallback
; ascent/descent this scene exists to guard lands within the same AA/
; rasteriser slack the sibling `.otf` fixture's header documents.

[ext_resource type="Theme" path="res://unit-control-scene-font-woff2.tres" id="1"]

